<section class="bg-white py-24 px-6">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-black leading-tight mb-6">
        A Practical, Biblical<br><em class="italic text-[#CC9200]">Solution</em>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">This isn't a typical finance camp. It's a 3-day immersive experience that weaves biblical wisdom with practical financial knowledge designed for young adults aged 16–21 who are ready to step into life with clarity, purpose, and financial confidence.</p>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">Each day covers a pillar of financial wisdom rooted in scripture and supported by expert knowledge from financial markets, corporate experience, and faith communities.</p>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">The world is changing fast. Your child is under more pressure than ever to succeed quickly, live loudly, and spend recklessly. This camp gives them a different foundation: one built on God's word and real-world financial skill.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
      {[
        { label: 'Format', value: 'Virtual (Zoom)' },
        { label: 'Daily Time', value: '4PM GMT+1' },
        { label: 'Dates', value: 'Aug 12–14, 2026' },
        { label: 'Age Group', value: '16–21 Years' },
        { label: 'Post-Camp', value: '4 Quarterly Check-ins' },
        { label: 'Investment', value: '₦140,000 / $100' },
      ].map((stat) => (
        <div class="border border-gray-200 p-4">
          <div class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-gray-400 mb-1">{stat.label}</div>
          <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-black">{stat.value}</div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
